  "body": "All agents buyers welcome, contact Ping for conjunctional\r\n\r\nUnlock the potential of this exceptional 794sqm (more or less) flat, freehold site in the heart of Bucklands Beach - an outstanding opportunity for developers, builders, and astute investors.\r\n\r\nKey Highlights:\r\n*794sqm (approx.) flat, freehold section with underground services on site\r\n*Mixed Housing Suburban zone - development potential (subject to council approval)\r\n*Triple school zones including Macleans College, BBI and Pigeon Mountain School\r\n*Close to beaches, marina, cafes, transport, and everyday amenities\r\n*Rare opportunity - land of this scale and location is increasingly hard to secure\r\n*Flexible settlement terms\r\n\r\nZoned Mixed Housing Suburban and supported by underground services already in place, this property offers outstanding development flexibility and ease of planning. Opportunities of this nature are rarely available in such a well-established and highly desirable neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned within walking distance to Pigeon Mountain School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate, and Macleans College, the property sits in a top-tier education zone that continues to drive strong demand from families and underpin long-term value.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the benefits of a coastal lifestyle just minutes from Bucklands Beach, Eastern Beach, Half Moon Bay Marina, and well-connected transport options including bus routes and ferry services to the CBD.\r\n\r\nWhether you're planning to subdivide, redevelop, or secure a landholding for the future, this is a rare chance to acquire one of the few remaining large, flat sites in this sought-after East Auckland location.",
